    {
      "type": "note",
      "id": "wubFO",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -560,
      "name": "README · Civitai theme kit",
      "width": 1200,
      "height": 440,
      "content": "CIVITAI THEME KIT + COLLABORATIVE COLLECTIONS REDESIGN\n\nTOKENS (168 variables)\n- Palette color-<hue>-0..9 copied verbatim from tailwind.config.js and src/providers/ThemeProvider.tsx (the two are identical). Unthemed fixed hexes.\n- Semantic tokens (bg-*, text-*, border, primary, accent, buzz, success, danger, warning) carry a `mode: dark | light` theme axis. Set theme:{mode:'light'} on any frame to preview light.\n- Scale tokens are Mantine v7 defaults: space/radius/fs. Breakpoints from src/utils/breakpoints.json.\n- primary is blue because createTheme never sets primaryColor - that is Mantine's default, not a choice.\n- font-body 'Inter' is a STAND-IN. The app ships a system stack (-apple-system, Segoe UI, Roboto...). Inter is the closest proxy for layout metrics only; it is not a Civitai brand font.\n\nCOMPONENTS (y 0-830) are the reusable kit. SCREENS (y 1000+) are the redesign.\n\nPencil cannot reference components across .pen files and its MCP tools only ever target the\nactive editor, so this kit cannot be imported. To seed another design file, replay the snippets in\ndocs/design/civitai-pencil-theme.md against that file while it is the active editor."
    },
    {
